    {
      "designator": "CS23-0",
      "grouping_at_time": "Subpart C \u2014 Structure",
      "title_at_revision": "Sideload on engine mount",
      "text": "(a) Each engine mount and its supporting structure must be designed for a limit load factor in a lateral direction, for the sideload on the engine mount, of not less than \u2013 (1) 1\u00b733; or (2) One-third of the limit load factor for flight condition A. (b) The sideload prescribed in sub-paragraph (a) may be assumed to be independent of other flight conditions.",
